            "review_title": "Review at Phuc An Vegetarian & Cafe",
            "review_text": "LJ9\nAustralia61 contributions\n0\nWonderful Dining Experience\nNov 2019\nBeautifully designed place beginning with the walk on stepping stones across a small pond filled with amazing fish, at the entrance. The staff are very friendly and welcoming and willing to let me just sit and enjoy the place for a few hours even after finishing my meal. The food was wonderful. No oily after feel and very tasty and well-presented. It really is a top-class restaurant. Great value.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 5, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
