            "review_title": "Review at Phuc An Vegetarian & Cafe",
            "review_text": "Maurie M\nMelbourne, Australia14 contributions\n0\nStunning Vegetarian Food, Great Service, Wonderful Location.\nJan 2019 • Family\nChef has apparently been trained at a top European owned resort over many years and has taken these skills out onto the DaNang restaurant scene. Only a matter of time before this place will get harder and harder to get a seat during lunch/dinner as the secret of this place spreads and becomes more popular.\n\nFood is amazing, we were. DaNang for a week and discovered this place on the first day. We ended up going back every day! Couldn’t get enough. I’ll let it speak for itself when you try it!\n\nHard to find a place in Vietnam where the staff are genuinely attentive and pre-empting your requests ahead of time. Staff are always hovering but not ‘in your face’. Staff are polite (hard to find in most restaurants).\n\nWhat can I say, give it a go, you won’t be disappointed.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 16, 2019",
